.measure tran ER_C FIND V(xer) AT=106.367943p
.measure tran ER_D FIND V(xer) AT=494.367943p
.measure tran QBK_Z FIND V(xqbk) AT=1.500000p
.measure tran QBK_B FIND V(xqbk) AT=99.367943p
.measure tran QBK_C FIND V(xqbk) AT=106.367943p
.measure tran QBK_D FIND V(xqbk) AT=494.367943p
